Return your verdict in the enforced JSON schema (the runner writes the rendered report or "NO_ISSUES" sentinel to '{{ review_current_path }}'):
- If you find [CRITICAL] issues, set `verdict` to `"ISSUES"`, format the issues report in `issues_markdown`, and provide a concise `summary`.
- If you find NO [CRITICAL] issues, set `verdict` to `"NO_ISSUES"`, set `issues_markdown` to `"NO_ISSUES"`, and provide a concise `summary`. Do NOT write to '{{ review_current_path }}' directly.
